    "Accuracy is not guaranteed. It varies with the device, the object's shape and material, lighting, surroundings and scanning technique.": {
      "comment": "OnboardingView",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测量精度无法保证，会因设备、物体形状与材质、光线、周围环境和扫描手法而异。"
